DataTable.comment:
 This library helps you create sortable tables with pagination and filter options.
The crucial feature is that it lets you own your data separately and keep it in
whatever format is best for you. This way you are free to change your data without
worrying about the table &ldquo;getting out of sync&rdquo; with the data. Having a single
source of truth is pretty great!

I recommend checking out the [examples] to get a feel for how it works.

[examples]: https://github.com/lindenlion/gren-datatables/tree/mama/examples


